SUMMARY:Men's Breakfast Discussion Group
DESCRIPTION:The Men’s Breakfast Discussion Group (Men’s Breakfast for short) welcomes all men to join us the second Saturday of each month for a potluck breakfast followed by group discussion on a reflective topping chosen by our members. The Breakfast begins at 8 AM\, followed by our discussion from 9 to 11 AM. \nIf you cannot attend the discussion in person\, you are welcomed to join us via Zoom. \nContact Carroll Canipe at canipecarroll@gmail.com for more information and Charlie St. Clare at charlie42stclair@gmail.com for information and the Zoom link.  Hope you can join us for the opportunity for great fellowship and food!
URL:https://uuasheville.org/event/monthly-mens-breakfast-discussion-group/2026-10-10/
LOCATION:23 Ed Board\, 23 Edwin Place\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:*Social Groups - LOVING
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://uuasheville.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/MB-3rd-Try-2nd-Sat-Mens-Breakfast-8-AM-in-23-Carroll.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Carroll Canipe":MAILTO:canipecarroll@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Unitarian Universalist Congregation of Asheville
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261011T091500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261011T100000
DTSTAMP:20260923T002918Z
CREATED:20260923T002918Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260923T002918Z
UID:10006041-1791710100-1791712800@uuasheville.org
SUMMARY:9:15 Contemplative Service
DESCRIPTION:At 9:15 AM\, we have a 40-45 minute Contemplative Worship Service. This service invites participants into a reflective\, more meditative space\, and includes silence\, beautiful recorded music and videos\, and opportunities for sharing. It also features the sermon and theme which will be the focus in the second service at 11:15 AM. This service is not livestreamed.\, and it include childcare but not a full religious education program. This service will be particularly good if you need quiet in order to hear well or focus\, would prefer a little more space around you\, or seek a more contemplative communal experience. \nBetween services\, at 10 am we will have coffee hour and special programs. Whether you come to the early service or the later service\, we encourage you to consider arriving at 10 am for coffee\, conversation\, and special programs including conversations with the Board\, or Minister & lay-led justice or adult education offerings.
URL:https://uuasheville.org/event/915-contemplative-service-2026-2027/2026-10-11/
LOCATION:*1 Sanctuary\, 1 Edwin Place\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:**Sunday AM - LITURGY,**Worship - LITURGY
ORGANIZER;CN="Rev. Audette Fulbright Fulson":MAILTO:RevAudette@UUAsheville.org
END:VEVENT
