SUMMARY:Newcomer Gathering
DESCRIPTION:Newcomer Events Every Third Sunday \nNew to UU AVL? We host newcomer gatherings on the third Sunday of each month\, in between services. Learn more about UU Asheville\, Meet other newcomers\, and eat snacks!\nQuestions? Reach out to Trevor Johnson.
URL:https://uuasheville.org/event/monthly-newcomer-gathering-october-2026/
